	A bitmap field, representing the optional fields (_o) that will be present in this structure.  The
	bit values for each field are as follows :
	H223MUX_H245_CAP_O_MOBILE_OPERATION_TRANSMIT_CAP 0x04, H223MUX_H245_CAP_O_ANNEX_C 0x08, 
	H223MUX_H245_CAP_O_BIT_RATE 0x10, H223MUX_H245_CAP_O_MOBILE_MULTILINK_FRAME_CAP 0x20
